 ## Operating characteristics
 
-**Time Complexity**: $O(1)$ per primitive evaluation. CSG operations add a constant factor proportional to the number of children in the scene graph.
-**Memory Complexity**: $O(1)$ for primitives. Scene graph size depends on the number of primitives.
-**Measured Performance**: Highly efficient on GPUs due to lack of branching and simple arithmetic. Performance scales linearly with the number of primitives in the scene [S1, S4, unofficial].
