 ## Background
-The concept of Signed Distance Fields for rendering was popularized by Inigo Quilez in his blog posts and books on ray marching [S1, S3, unofficial]. The mathematical foundations of CSG with distance fields were established by Hart [S4, unofficial]. The technique has become a staple in real-time graphics for creating procedural geometry, VFX, and stylized rendering.
